    "notes": {
        "ca2fe3ff-b725-4b86-a500-c403dc0fe72b": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 560,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 288,
            "content": "## Test data assumption: one real Nuki device\n\nNuki has no sandbox. The connected account (API token with the scopes smartlock.readOnly, smartlock.action, smartlock.auth and smartlock.log) must hold at least one Smart Lock that is online. The flow takes the first device Find Smartlocks returns, so no device ID is hardcoded.\n\nThe device must have at least one activity log entry (lock or unlock it once in the Nuki app), otherwise Find Log Entries throws on the \"First Item Only\" output."
        }
    }
